{{Documentation/Header}}
Embeds a '''bilibili''' cover video as a sample, via the EmbedVideo extension. The bilibili counterpart to the <code>ytsample</code> and <code>nndsample</code> parameters of {{T|Utaite}}.

==Syntax==
{{T|BBsample|block=1
|v1=id =
|v2=song =
|v3=singer =
|v4=producer =
|v5=dim =
|v6=align =
|v7=alt =
}}

The video ID may also be given as the '''second positional parameter'''.

==Example==
<pre>{{BBsample|id=BV1xx411c7XD|song=Song Title|singer=Hanser|producer=Producer Name}}</pre>

{| class="dataTable sortable"
! Parameter !! Aliases !! Label !! Description !! Type !! Default !! Status
|-
| <code>id</code> || <code>2</code> || Video ID || The bilibili video ID. || string || – || <span style="color:red;font-weight:bold;">Required</span>
|-
| <code>song</code> || – || Song || Song title, used in the caption. || string || A sample of a cover song ||
|-
| <code>singer</code> || – || Singer || Performer credited in the caption. || string || {{T|BBsample/name}} ||
|-
| <code>producer</code> || – || Producer || Adds ", originally composed by …" to the caption. || string || – ||
|-
| <code>dim</code> || – || Dimensions || Player width. || string || 300px ||
|-
| <code>align</code> || – || Alignment || Float alignment of the player. || string || left ||
|-
| <code>alt</code> || – || Caption override || Replaces the entire generated caption. || string || – ||
|}

